OL,3,GNEWSA'Relief' as cuts to young carers'
OL,4,Afunding scrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision to scrap plans to cut
OL,7,Fyouth club funding to support young
OL,8,Fcarers feels like a "massive weight has
OL,9,Fbeen lifted", says a young carer's mum.
OL,11,FThe proposal would have seen funding
OL,12,Fcut for 10 youth clubs from April to
OL,13,Fsave #185,000, as part of ongoing
OL,14,Fefforts to prevent Somerset Council
OL,15,Fgoing bankrupt.
OL,17,FBut at a meeting on Wednesday, the
OL,18,Fdecision to cease both the Young Carers
OL,19,Fin Schools (YCIS) programme and the
OL,20,FYoung Carers Clubs scheme was thrown
OL,21,Fout.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
