OL,3,GNEWSA'Relief' as cuts to young carers'
OL,4,Afunding scrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FMelanie, whose 13-year-old daughter
OL,7,FDaisy has gained confidence from
OL,8,Fattending the youth club, said the news
OL,9,Fwas a "massive sense of relief".
